		animation = true,
		json = [[{"ok":true,"reply_markdown":"**Source:** `tool:animation` - a deterministic template generator chosen by the keyword router (confidence 1.00); this is not neural-model output. Verification: 3/3 checks passed.\n\n**kick** animation `GodmodeKick` (one-shot, 1.20 s, priority Action, speed x1, intensity x1): Front kick: guard, chamber the knee (anticipation), snap the leg out, re-chamber, plant.\n\nKeyframes: neutral, guard, chamber, kick, rechamber, plant, neutral.\n\nThe plugin builds a KeyframeSequence in `ReplicatedStorage.GodmodeAnimations`; the LocalScript in `StarterCharacterScripts` toggles it with **G** (Studio test via a temporary id; publish it and paste the asset id for live games).\n\n_Provenance: procedural keyframes designed from the reference video TITLES supplied by the user (the videos were not watched; no motion capture)._\n\n**Proposed only - nothing has been changed in Studio.** 2 action(s) await your approval in the plugin:\n- `a1` create_animation: Create kick animation (one-shot, 1.20s)\n- `a2` create_script: Play GodmodeKick on the local character","source":"offline:tool:animation","intent":{"name":"animation","confidence":1.0,"router":"keyword-regex","params":{"style":"kick"}},"actions":[{"type":"create_animation","description":"Create kick animation (one-shot, 1.20s)","name":"GodmodeKick","parent_path":"ReplicatedStorage.GodmodeAnimations","rig":"R15","looped":false,"priority":"Action","duration":1.2,"hierarchy":{"HumanoidRootPart":null,"LowerTorso":"HumanoidRootPart","UpperTorso":"LowerTorso","Head":"UpperTorso","LeftUpperArm":"UpperTorso","LeftLowerArm":"LeftUpperArm","LeftHand":"LeftLowerArm","RightUpperArm":"UpperTorso","RightLowerArm":"RightUpperArm","RightHand":"RightLowerArm","LeftUpperLeg":"LowerTorso","LeftLowerLeg":"LeftUpperLeg","LeftFoot":"LeftLowerLeg","RightUpperLeg":"LowerTorso","RightLowerLeg":"RightUpperLeg","RightFoot":"RightLowerLeg"},"joints":{"LowerTorso":"Root","UpperTorso":"Waist","Head":"Neck","LeftUpperArm":